This tree is a Rust rewrite of the Go and Next.js implementation previously published
in this repository (https://github.com/Clementine-Miles/ARUSTEX), whose history and
contributors are recorded in git and in CHANGELOG.md. The legacy source remains
available in the repository history.

The module layering follows the architecture of ARTEX-Desktop
(https://github.com/froiibn/ARTEX-Desktop), used as a design reference.

The legacy web frontend contained MIT-licensed material (copyright 2024 Mohammed
Arham Khan). That frontend is not part of this tree; its license text is kept in the
repository history with the code it covered.

Third-party Rust crates are used under their own licenses, as listed in Cargo.lock
and each crate's metadata.
